<title>SWITZERLAND: Ascom details H1 by corporate segment.</title>
<headline>Ascom details H1 by corporate segment.</headline>
<dateline>BERNE 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Group operating result     39		  vs 28</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Telecommunications	   79		  vs 59</p>
<p> Enterprise Networks	  39 loss	   vs 18 loss</p>
<p> Service Automation	   10		  vs 6</p>
<p> Group expense/consolidate  11 loss	   vs 19 loss</p>
<p> Group new orders	     1,506	     vs 1,462</p>
<p>of which:</p>
<p> Telecommunications	   977		 vs 872</p>
<p> Enterprise Networks	  165		 vs 178</p>
<p> Service Automation	   401		 vs 446</p>
