<p> Enterprise Networks	  135		 vs 177</p>
<p> Service Automation	   379		 vs 406</p>
<p>NOTE - Full company name is Ascom Holding AG.</p>
<p>-- Peter Nielsen, Zurich newsroom 41-1-631 7340</p>
